-- Tests for Chuong I (Dieu 1-14). Every expected value is read from the source lines cited,
-- never from what the code printed. V1 is pinned at 1 June 2025, V2 at 1 March 2026, V3 at
-- 1 August 2026 (law08-vintage.l4). A fixture names only the facts that are TRUE (the rest
-- default to FALSE, 0, YMD 2000 1 1, NOTHING or EMPTY, as tools/expand.py documents).

§ `Tests: Chuong I`

§§ `Dieu 1(2)`

-- src:30 | 2. Luật này không áp dụng đối với bảo hiểm xã hội, bảo hiểm y tế, bảo hiểm tiền
-- src:31 | gửi và các loại bảo hiểm khác do Nhà nước thực hiện không mang tính kinh doanh.
@ref Dieu 1 (src:30-31)
`a social insurance scheme` MEANS `An insurance scheme` WITH
    `is social insurance` IS TRUE
    `is health insurance` IS FALSE
    `is deposit insurance` IS FALSE
    `is another kind of insurance the State provides without a business character` IS FALSE
`a State health insurance scheme` MEANS `An insurance scheme` WITH
    `is social insurance` IS FALSE
    `is health insurance` IS TRUE
    `is deposit insurance` IS FALSE
    `is another kind of insurance the State provides without a business character` IS FALSE
`a deposit insurance scheme` MEANS `An insurance scheme` WITH
    `is social insurance` IS FALSE
    `is health insurance` IS FALSE
    `is deposit insurance` IS TRUE
    `is another kind of insurance the State provides without a business character` IS FALSE
`another State non-business scheme` MEANS `An insurance scheme` WITH
    `is social insurance` IS FALSE
    `is health insurance` IS FALSE
    `is deposit insurance` IS FALSE
    `is another kind of insurance the State provides without a business character` IS TRUE
`a commercial scheme` MEANS `An insurance scheme` WITH
    `is social insurance` IS FALSE
    `is health insurance` IS FALSE
    `is deposit insurance` IS FALSE
    `is another kind of insurance the State provides without a business character` IS FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 1(2): the Law applies to the scheme` `a social insurance scheme`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 1(2): the Law applies to the scheme` `a State health insurance scheme`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 1(2): the Law applies to the scheme` `a deposit insurance scheme`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 1(2): the Law applies to the scheme` `another State non-business scheme`
#ASSERT `Dieu 1(2): the Law applies to the scheme` `a commercial scheme`

§§ `Dieu 3`

-- src:50 | 1. Trường hợp luật khác ban hành sau ngày Luật này có hiệu lực thi hành cần
-- src:51 | quy định khác với quy định của Luật này về hợp đồng bảo hiểm, thành lập, tổ chức
-- src:52 | hoạt động, hoạt động nghiệp vụ, tài chính, hạch toán kế toán và báo cáo tài chính,
-- src:53 | khả năng thanh toán và biện pháp can thiệp đối với doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, doanh
-- src:54 | nghiệp tái bảo hiểm, chi nhánh nước ngoài tại Việt Nam, tổ chức tương hỗ cung
-- src:55 | cấp bảo hiểm vi mô, doanh nghiệp môi giới bảo hiểm thì phải xác định cụ thể nội
-- src:56 | dung thực hiện hoặc không thực hiện theo quy định của Luật này.
@ref Dieu 3 (src:50-56)
`a later law that differs and says so` MEANS `A later law` WITH
    `was issued after the Law took effect` IS TRUE
    `differs on a matter Dieu 3(1) lists` IS TRUE
    `states specifically which content is applied or not applied under this Law` IS TRUE
`a later law that differs and is silent` MEANS `A later law` WITH
    `was issued after the Law took effect` IS TRUE
    `differs on a matter Dieu 3(1) lists` IS TRUE
    `states specifically which content is applied or not applied under this Law` IS FALSE
`a later law that does not differ` MEANS `A later law` WITH
    `was issued after the Law took effect` IS TRUE
    `differs on a matter Dieu 3(1) lists` IS FALSE
    `states specifically which content is applied or not applied under this Law` IS FALSE
`an earlier law that differs` MEANS `A later law` WITH
    `was issued after the Law took effect` IS FALSE
    `differs on a matter Dieu 3(1) lists` IS TRUE
    `states specifically which content is applied or not applied under this Law` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `Dieu 3(1): the later law meets the condition of Dieu 3(1)` `a later law that differs and says so`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 3(1): the later law meets the condition of Dieu 3(1)` `a later law that differs and is silent`
#ASSERT `Dieu 3(1): the later law meets the condition of Dieu 3(1)` `a later law that does not differ`
#ASSERT `Dieu 3(1): the later law meets the condition of Dieu 3(1)` `an earlier law that differs`

-- src:57 | 2. Các bên tham gia hợp đồng bảo hiểm, tái bảo hiểm, môi giới bảo hiểm có
-- src:58 | thể thỏa thuận áp dụng tập quán quốc tế trong trường hợp có ít nhất một trong các
-- src:59 | bên tham gia là tổ chức, cá nhân nước ngoài hoặc các bên tham gia là tổ chức Việt
-- src:60 | Nam, công dân Việt Nam nhưng đối tượng bảo hiểm hoặc việc thực hiện hợp đồng
-- src:61 | ở nước ngoài. Nếu hậu quả của việc áp dụng tập quán quốc tế trái với các nguyên
-- src:62 | tắc cơ bản của pháp luật Việt Nam thì pháp luật Việt Nam được áp dụng.
@ref Dieu 3 (src:57-62)
`a custom agreed with a foreign party` MEANS `An agreement to apply international custom` WITH
    `the contract is one of insurance, reinsurance or brokerage` IS TRUE
    `the parties agreed to apply the custom` IS TRUE
    `at least one party is a foreign organisation or individual` IS TRUE
    `all parties are Vietnamese organisations or citizens` IS FALSE
    `the object of insurance or the performance of the contract is abroad` IS FALSE
    `applying the custom would be contrary to the basic principles of Vietnamese law` IS FALSE
`a custom agreed by Vietnamese parties for a risk abroad` MEANS `An agreement to apply international custom` WITH
    `the contract is one of insurance, reinsurance or brokerage` IS TRUE
    `the parties agreed to apply the custom` IS TRUE
    `at least one party is a foreign organisation or individual` IS FALSE
    `all parties are Vietnamese organisations or citizens` IS TRUE
    `the object of insurance or the performance of the contract is abroad` IS TRUE
    `applying the custom would be contrary to the basic principles of Vietnamese law` IS FALSE
`a custom agreed by Vietnamese parties for a risk at home` MEANS `An agreement to apply international custom` WITH
    `the contract is one of insurance, reinsurance or brokerage` IS TRUE
    `the parties agreed to apply the custom` IS TRUE
    `at least one party is a foreign organisation or individual` IS FALSE
    `all parties are Vietnamese organisations or citizens` IS TRUE
    `the object of insurance or the performance of the contract is abroad` IS FALSE
    `applying the custom would be contrary to the basic principles of Vietnamese law` IS FALSE
`a custom with a foreign party but not agreed` MEANS `An agreement to apply international custom` WITH
    `the contract is one of insurance, reinsurance or brokerage` IS TRUE
    `the parties agreed to apply the custom` IS FALSE
    `at least one party is a foreign organisation or individual` IS TRUE
    `all parties are Vietnamese organisations or citizens` IS FALSE
    `the object of insurance or the performance of the contract is abroad` IS FALSE
    `applying the custom would be contrary to the basic principles of Vietnamese law` IS FALSE
`a custom whose consequence offends Vietnamese principles` MEANS `An agreement to apply international custom` WITH
    `the contract is one of insurance, reinsurance or brokerage` IS TRUE
    `the parties agreed to apply the custom` IS TRUE
    `at least one party is a foreign organisation or individual` IS TRUE
    `all parties are Vietnamese organisations or citizens` IS FALSE
    `the object of insurance or the performance of the contract is abroad` IS FALSE
    `applying the custom would be contrary to the basic principles of Vietnamese law` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `Dieu 3(2): international custom applies` `a custom agreed with a foreign party`
#ASSERT `Dieu 3(2): international custom applies` `a custom agreed by Vietnamese parties for a risk abroad`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 3(2): international custom applies` `a custom agreed by Vietnamese parties for a risk at home`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 3(2): international custom applies` `a custom with a foreign party but not agreed`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 3(2): international custom applies` `a custom whose consequence offends Vietnamese principles`

-- Dieu 3(3) is added by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(1): V1 has no such provision.
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:24 | 1. Bổ sung khoản 3 vào sau khoản 2 Điều 3 như sau:
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:26 | “3. Tổ chức, cá nhân có quyền tham gia góp vốn thành lập, quản lý, kiểm
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:27 | soát doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, doanh nghiệp tái bảo hiểm, doanh nghiệp môi giới
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:28 | bảo hiểm, tổ chức tương hỗ cung cấp bảo hiểm vi mô, chi nhánh nước ngoài tại
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:29 | Việt Nam, trừ trường hợp tổ chức, cá nhân không có quyền thành lập và quản lý
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:30 | doanh nghiệp tại Việt Nam theo quy định của Luật Doanh nghiệp.”.
@ref Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1 (src:law139-2025-qh15:24-30)
`a foreign investor with the right to found an enterprise` MEANS `A would-be investor` WITH
    `the target is an insurer, reinsurer, broker, mutual organisation or foreign branch` IS TRUE
    `has no right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` IS FALSE
`a person with no right to found an enterprise` MEANS `A would-be investor` WITH
    `the target is an insurer, reinsurer, broker, mutual organisation or foreign branch` IS TRUE
    `has no right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` IS TRUE
`an investor in a target the Law does not list` MEANS `A would-be investor` WITH
    `the target is an insurer, reinsurer, broker, mutual organisation or foreign branch` IS FALSE
    `has no right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` IS FALSE

#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 3(3): the person has the right to contribute capital to found, manage and control` `a foreign investor with the right to found an enterprise`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 3(3): the person has the right to contribute capital to found, manage and control` `a foreign investor with the right to found an enterprise`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 3(3): the person has the right to contribute capital to found, manage and control` `a foreign investor with the right to found an enterprise`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 3(3): the person has the right to contribute capital to found, manage and control` `a person with no right to found an enterprise`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 3(3): the person has the right to contribute capital to found, manage and control` `an investor in a target the Law does not list`)

§§ `Dieu 4: the activities (4(1)-(12))`

