`an independent loss adjuster` MEANS `An ancillary activity` WITH
    `is advice on insurance programmes, products, risk management or loss prevention` IS FALSE
    `identifies, classifies and assesses the nature and degree of insurable risk` IS FALSE
    `collects and analyses statistics, computes premium, reserves, capital or solvency` IS FALSE
    `determines the condition, cause and extent of a loss and apportions liability` IS TRUE
    `helps a policyholder, insured person, beneficiary or insurer with claims procedures` IS FALSE
    `is done by the insurer, reinsurer, branch or mutual organisation itself for its own business` IS FALSE
`an insurer adjusting its own losses` MEANS `An ancillary activity` WITH
    `is advice on insurance programmes, products, risk management or loss prevention` IS FALSE
    `identifies, classifies and assesses the nature and degree of insurable risk` IS FALSE
    `collects and analyses statistics, computes premium, reserves, capital or solvency` IS FALSE
    `determines the condition, cause and extent of a loss and apportions liability` IS TRUE
    `helps a policyholder, insured person, beneficiary or insurer with claims procedures` IS FALSE
    `is done by the insurer, reinsurer, branch or mutual organisation itself for its own business` IS TRUE
`an actuary computing premium` MEANS `An ancillary activity` WITH
    `is advice on insurance programmes, products, risk management or loss prevention` IS FALSE
    `identifies, classifies and assesses the nature and degree of insurable risk` IS FALSE
    `collects and analyses statistics, computes premium, reserves, capital or solvency` IS TRUE
    `determines the condition, cause and extent of a loss and apportions liability` IS FALSE
    `helps a policyholder, insured person, beneficiary or insurer with claims procedures` IS FALSE
    `is done by the insurer, reinsurer, branch or mutual organisation itself for its own business` IS FALSE
`an adviser` MEANS `An ancillary activity` WITH
    `is advice on insurance programmes, products, risk management or loss prevention` IS TRUE
    `identifies, classifies and assesses the nature and degree of insurable risk` IS FALSE
    `collects and analyses statistics, computes premium, reserves, capital or solvency` IS FALSE
    `determines the condition, cause and extent of a loss and apportions liability` IS FALSE
    `helps a policyholder, insured person, beneficiary or insurer with claims procedures` IS FALSE
    `is done by the insurer, reinsurer, branch or mutual organisation itself for its own business` IS FALSE
`a risk assessor` MEANS `An ancillary activity` WITH
    `is advice on insurance programmes, products, risk management or loss prevention` IS FALSE
    `identifies, classifies and assesses the nature and degree of insurable risk` IS TRUE
    `collects and analyses statistics, computes premium, reserves, capital or solvency` IS FALSE
    `determines the condition, cause and extent of a loss and apportions liability` IS FALSE
    `helps a policyholder, insured person, beneficiary or insurer with claims procedures` IS FALSE
    `is done by the insurer, reinsurer, branch or mutual organisation itself for its own business` IS FALSE
`a claims helper` MEANS `An ancillary activity` WITH
    `is advice on insurance programmes, products, risk management or loss prevention` IS FALSE
    `identifies, classifies and assesses the nature and degree of insurable risk` IS FALSE
    `collects and analyses statistics, computes premium, reserves, capital or solvency` IS FALSE
    `determines the condition, cause and extent of a loss and apportions liability` IS FALSE
    `helps a policyholder, insured person, beneficiary or insurer with claims procedures` IS TRUE
    `is done by the insurer, reinsurer, branch or mutual organisation itself for its own business` IS FALSE
`a bystander` MEANS `An ancillary activity` WITH
    `is advice on insurance programmes, products, risk management or loss prevention` IS FALSE
    `identifies, classifies and assesses the nature and degree of insurable risk` IS FALSE
    `collects and analyses statistics, computes premium, reserves, capital or solvency` IS FALSE
    `determines the condition, cause and extent of a loss and apportions liability` IS FALSE
    `helps a policyholder, insured person, beneficiary or insurer with claims procedures` IS FALSE
    `is done by the insurer, reinsurer, branch or mutual organisation itself for its own business` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `Dieu 4(7): the activity is an ancillary insurance service` `an independent loss adjuster`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(7): the activity is an ancillary insurance service` `an insurer adjusting its own losses`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(7): the activity is an ancillary insurance service` `a bystander`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(8): the activity is advice (tu van)` `an adviser`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(9): the activity is insurance risk assessment` `a risk assessor`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(10): the activity is actuarial work (tinh toan bao hiem)` `an actuary computing premium`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(11): the activity is insurance loss adjustment (giam dinh ton that)` `an independent loss adjuster`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(12): the activity is claims support` `a claims helper`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(12): the activity is claims support` `a bystander`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(1): the activity is insurance business activity (hoat dong kinh doanh bao hiem)` `an authorised agent that only collects premium` `a bystander`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(1): the activity is insurance business activity (hoat dong kinh doanh bao hiem)` `a person doing neither` `an actuary computing premium`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(1): the activity is insurance business activity (hoat dong kinh doanh bao hiem)` `a person doing neither` `a bystander`

