@ref Dieu 4 (src:132-190)
`an agreement to pay premium against cover` MEANS `A contract arrangement` WITH
    `is an agreement between the policyholder and the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS TRUE
    `the policyholder must pay premium under it` IS TRUE
    `the insurer, branch or mutual organisation must compensate or pay as agreed under it` IS TRUE
    `several insurers or branches of foreign non-life insurers agreed to make it with the policyholder in one contract` IS FALSE
    `they take premium and compensate or pay in the ratio agreed in the contract` IS FALSE
`a promise to pay with no premium` MEANS `A contract arrangement` WITH
    `is an agreement between the policyholder and the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS TRUE
    `the policyholder must pay premium under it` IS FALSE
    `the insurer, branch or mutual organisation must compensate or pay as agreed under it` IS TRUE
    `several insurers or branches of foreign non-life insurers agreed to make it with the policyholder in one contract` IS FALSE
    `they take premium and compensate or pay in the ratio agreed in the contract` IS FALSE
`two insurers sharing one contract` MEANS `A contract arrangement` WITH
    `is an agreement between the policyholder and the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder must pay premium under it` IS FALSE
    `the insurer, branch or mutual organisation must compensate or pay as agreed under it` IS FALSE
    `several insurers or branches of foreign non-life insurers agreed to make it with the policyholder in one contract` IS TRUE
    `they take premium and compensate or pay in the ratio agreed in the contract` IS TRUE
`two insurers with no agreed ratio` MEANS `A contract arrangement` WITH
    `is an agreement between the policyholder and the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder must pay premium under it` IS FALSE
    `the insurer, branch or mutual organisation must compensate or pay as agreed under it` IS FALSE
    `several insurers or branches of foreign non-life insurers agreed to make it with the policyholder in one contract` IS TRUE
    `they take premium and compensate or pay in the ratio agreed in the contract` IS FALSE
`a buyer who contracts and pays` MEANS `A role in a contract` WITH
    `concluded the contract of insurance with an insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS TRUE
    `pays the insurance premium` IS TRUE
    `has property, civil liability, health, life, an obligation or an economic interest insured under the contract` IS FALSE
    `was designated by the policyholder or the insured person to receive the insurance money as the contract agrees` IS FALSE
`a person who contracts but another pays` MEANS `A role in a contract` WITH
    `concluded the contract of insurance with an insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS TRUE
    `pays the insurance premium` IS FALSE
    `has property, civil liability, health, life, an obligation or an economic interest insured under the contract` IS FALSE
    `was designated by the policyholder or the insured person to receive the insurance money as the contract agrees` IS FALSE
`a person whose life is insured` MEANS `A role in a contract` WITH
    `concluded the contract of insurance with an insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS FALSE
    `pays the insurance premium` IS FALSE
    `has property, civil liability, health, life, an obligation or an economic interest insured under the contract` IS TRUE
    `was designated by the policyholder or the insured person to receive the insurance money as the contract agrees` IS FALSE
`a designated recipient` MEANS `A role in a contract` WITH
    `concluded the contract of insurance with an insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS FALSE
    `pays the insurance premium` IS FALSE
    `has property, civil liability, health, life, an obligation or an economic interest insured under the contract` IS FALSE
    `was designated by the policyholder or the insured person to receive the insurance money as the contract agrees` IS TRUE
`a payable event as agreed` MEANS `An occurrence` WITH
    `is an objective event` IS TRUE
    `was agreed by the parties or is provided by law` IS TRUE
    `obliges the insurer, branch or mutual organisation to compensate or pay under the contract when it occurs` IS TRUE
`an event nobody agreed` MEANS `An occurrence` WITH
    `is an objective event` IS TRUE
    `was agreed by the parties or is provided by law` IS FALSE
    `obliges the insurer, branch or mutual organisation to compensate or pay under the contract when it occurs` IS TRUE
`a premium paid as agreed` MEANS `A payment` WITH
    `is made by the policyholder to the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS TRUE
    `is required by law or agreed by the parties in the contract` IS TRUE
`a gift to an insurer` MEANS `A payment` WITH
    `is made by the policyholder to the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS TRUE
    `is required by law or agreed by the parties in the contract` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `Dieu 4(16): the arrangement is a contract of insurance` `an agreement to pay premium against cover`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(16): the arrangement is a contract of insurance` `a promise to pay with no premium`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(29): the arrangement is co-insurance (dong bao hiem)` `two insurers sharing one contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(29): the arrangement is co-insurance (dong bao hiem)` `two insurers with no agreed ratio`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(24): the person is the policyholder (ben mua bao hiem)` `a buyer who contracts and pays`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(24): the person is the policyholder (ben mua bao hiem)` `a person who contracts but another pays`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(25): the person is the insured person (nguoi duoc bao hiem)` `a person whose life is insured`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(26): the person is a beneficiary (nguoi thu huong)` `a designated recipient`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(26): the person is a beneficiary (nguoi thu huong)` `a person whose life is insured`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(27): the occurrence is an insured event (su kien bao hiem)` `a payable event as agreed`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(27): the occurrence is an insured event (su kien bao hiem)` `an event nobody agreed`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(28): the payment is insurance premium (phi bao hiem)` `a premium paid as agreed`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(28): the payment is insurance premium (phi bao hiem)` `a gift to an insurer`

§§ `Dieu 6`

-- src:208 | 1. Tổ chức, cá nhân tại Việt Nam có nhu cầu tham gia bảo hiểm chỉ được tham
-- src:209 | gia bảo hiểm tại doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi
-- src:210 | nhân thọ nước ngoài, tổ chức tương hỗ cung cấp bảo hiểm vi mô được cấp giấy
-- src:211 | phép thành lập và hoạt động tại Việt Nam, trừ trường hợp sử dụng dịch vụ bảo
-- src:212 | hiểm qua biên giới theo điều ước quốc tế mà nước Cộng hòa xã hội chủ nghĩa Việt
-- src:213 | Nam là thành viên.
-- src:214 | 2. Chính phủ quy định chi tiết việc cung cấp và sử dụng dịch vụ bảo hiểm qua
-- src:215 | biên giới, dịch vụ môi giới bảo hiểm qua biên giới, dịch vụ phụ trợ bảo hiểm qua
-- src:216 | biên giới phù hợp với các điều ước quốc tế mà nước Cộng hòa xã hội chủ nghĩa
-- src:217 | Việt Nam là thành viên.
@ref Dieu 6 (src:208-217)
`a Vietnamese buyer at a licensed insurer` MEANS `A purchase of insurance` WITH
    `the buyer is an organisation or individual in Vietnam` IS TRUE
    `the seller holds a licence to establish and operate in Vietnam` IS TRUE
    `the insurance is a cross-border service under an international treaty to which Vietnam is a member` IS FALSE
`a Vietnamese buyer at an unlicensed foreign insurer` MEANS `A purchase of insurance` WITH
    `the buyer is an organisation or individual in Vietnam` IS TRUE
    `the seller holds a licence to establish and operate in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `the insurance is a cross-border service under an international treaty to which Vietnam is a member` IS FALSE
`the same under a treaty` MEANS `A purchase of insurance` WITH
    `the buyer is an organisation or individual in Vietnam` IS TRUE
    `the seller holds a licence to establish and operate in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `the insurance is a cross-border service under an international treaty to which Vietnam is a member` IS TRUE
`a foreign buyer abroad at a foreign insurer` MEANS `A purchase of insurance` WITH
    `the buyer is an organisation or individual in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `the seller holds a licence to establish and operate in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `the insurance is a cross-border service under an international treaty to which Vietnam is a member` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `Dieu 6(1): the purchase conforms` `a Vietnamese buyer at a licensed insurer`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 6(1): the purchase conforms` `a Vietnamese buyer at an unlicensed foreign insurer`
#ASSERT `Dieu 6(1): the purchase conforms` `the same under a treaty`
#ASSERT `Dieu 6(1): the purchase conforms` `a foreign buyer abroad at a foreign insurer`
#ASSERT count (`EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) `Dieu 6(2): the cross-border services the Government is to regulate`) EQUALS 3
#ASSERT count (`EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) `Dieu 6(2): the cross-border services the Government is to regulate`) EQUALS 3
#ASSERT count (`EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) `Dieu 6(2): the cross-border services the Government is to regulate`) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (elem `cross-border ancillary insurance service` `Dieu 6(2): the cross-border services the Government is to regulate`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (elem `cross-border ancillary insurance service` `Dieu 6(2): the cross-border services the Government is to regulate`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2020 6 1) `Dieu 6(2): the cross-border services the Government is to regulate`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 6(2): the Government's detailed rules on the cross-border service` `cross-border insurance`

§§ `Dieu 7`

#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 7(2): the Government's list of insurance lines for the type` `life insurance`

§§ `Dieu 8`

-- src:226 | 1. Bảo hiểm bắt buộc là sản phẩm bảo hiểm nhằm mục đích bảo vệ lợi ích
-- src:227 | công cộng, môi trường và an toàn xã hội.
-- src:228 | 2. Bảo hiểm bắt buộc bao gồm:
-- src:229 | a) Bảo hiểm bắt buộc trách nhiệm dân sự của chủ xe cơ giới;
-- src:230 | b) Bảo hiểm cháy, nổ bắt buộc;
-- src:231 | c) Bảo hiểm bắt buộc trong hoạt động đầu tư xây dựng;
-- src:232 | d) Bảo hiểm bắt buộc quy định tại luật khác đáp ứng quy định tại khoản 1
-- src:233 | Điều này.
-- src:234 | 10 CÔNG BÁO/Số 575 + 576/Ngày 17-7-2022
-- src:236 | 3. Tổ chức, cá nhân thuộc đối tượng tham gia bảo hiểm bắt buộc có nghĩa vụ
-- src:237 | mua bảo hiểm bắt buộc và được lựa chọn tham gia bảo hiểm bắt buộc tại doanh
-- src:238 | nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ nước ngoài được
-- src:239 | phép triển khai.
-- src:240 | 4. Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ
-- src:241 | nước ngoài được phép triển khai bảo hiểm bắt buộc không được từ chối bán khi
-- src:242 | tổ chức, cá nhân đáp ứng đủ điều kiện mua bảo hiểm bắt buộc theo quy định của
-- src:243 | pháp luật.
-- src:244 | 5. Chính phủ quy định chi tiết về điều kiện bảo hiểm, mức phí bảo hiểm, số
-- src:245 | tiền bảo hiểm tối thiểu đối với bảo hiểm bắt buộc quy định tại khoản 2 Điều này.
@ref Dieu 8 (src:226-245)
`compulsory motor insurance` MEANS `A product for the purposes of compulsory insurance` WITH
    `protects the public interest, the environment and social safety` IS FALSE
    `is civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners` IS TRUE
    `is compulsory fire and explosion insurance` IS FALSE
    `is insurance in construction investment activity` IS FALSE
    `is insurance in construction activity` IS FALSE
    `is compulsory under another law and meets Dieu 8(1)` IS FALSE
`compulsory fire and explosion insurance` MEANS `A product for the purposes of compulsory insurance` WITH
    `protects the public interest, the environment and social safety` IS FALSE
    `is civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners` IS FALSE
    `is compulsory fire and explosion insurance` IS TRUE
    `is insurance in construction investment activity` IS FALSE
    `is insurance in construction activity` IS FALSE
    `is compulsory under another law and meets Dieu 8(1)` IS FALSE
`insurance in construction investment activity only` MEANS `A product for the purposes of compulsory insurance` WITH
    `protects the public interest, the environment and social safety` IS FALSE
    `is civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners` IS FALSE
    `is compulsory fire and explosion insurance` IS FALSE
    `is insurance in construction investment activity` IS TRUE
    `is insurance in construction activity` IS FALSE
    `is compulsory under another law and meets Dieu 8(1)` IS FALSE
`insurance in construction activity only` MEANS `A product for the purposes of compulsory insurance` WITH
    `protects the public interest, the environment and social safety` IS FALSE
    `is civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners` IS FALSE
    `is compulsory fire and explosion insurance` IS FALSE
    `is insurance in construction investment activity` IS FALSE
    `is insurance in construction activity` IS TRUE
    `is compulsory under another law and meets Dieu 8(1)` IS FALSE
`compulsory insurance under another law` MEANS `A product for the purposes of compulsory insurance` WITH
    `protects the public interest, the environment and social safety` IS FALSE
    `is civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners` IS FALSE
    `is compulsory fire and explosion insurance` IS FALSE
    `is insurance in construction investment activity` IS FALSE
    `is insurance in construction activity` IS FALSE
    `is compulsory under another law and meets Dieu 8(1)` IS TRUE
`an optional product` MEANS `A product for the purposes of compulsory insurance` WITH
    `protects the public interest, the environment and social safety` IS TRUE
    `is civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners` IS FALSE
    `is compulsory fire and explosion insurance` IS FALSE
    `is insurance in construction investment activity` IS FALSE
    `is insurance in construction activity` IS FALSE
    `is compulsory under another law and meets Dieu 8(1)` IS FALSE
`a buyer bound to buy, refused by a permitted seller` MEANS `A sale of compulsory insurance` WITH
    `the buyer is within the class that must buy it` IS TRUE
    `the seller is permitted to offer it` IS TRUE
    `the buyer meets the conditions the law sets for buying` IS TRUE
    `the seller refused to sell` IS TRUE
`a buyer who fails the conditions, refused` MEANS `A sale of compulsory insurance` WITH
    `the buyer is within the class that must buy it` IS TRUE
    `the seller is permitted to offer it` IS TRUE
    `the buyer meets the conditions the law sets for buying` IS FALSE
    `the seller refused to sell` IS TRUE
`an unpermitted seller who refused` MEANS `A sale of compulsory insurance` WITH
    `the buyer is within the class that must buy it` IS TRUE
    `the seller is permitted to offer it` IS FALSE
    `the buyer meets the conditions the law sets for buying` IS TRUE
    `the seller refused to sell` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 8(2): the product is compulsory insurance` `compulsory motor insurance`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 8(2): the product is compulsory insurance` `compulsory fire and explosion insurance`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 8(2): the product is compulsory insurance` `compulsory insurance under another law`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 8(2): the product is compulsory insurance` `an optional product`)
