@ref Dieu 11 (src:279-292)
`a safe use with information safety` MEANS `A use of database information` WITH
    `the supplier is an insurer, reinsurer, branch, broker, ancillary provider or mutual organisation` IS FALSE
    `supplied information on the policyholder, insured person, object, agent and other related information` IS FALSE
    `ensured confidentiality` IS TRUE
    `ensured information safety` IS TRUE
    `ensured cybersecurity` IS FALSE
    `complied with the law on privacy, personal, family and business secrets` IS TRUE
    `used the information for the purpose supplied` IS TRUE
    `gave it to a third party` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder or insured person agreed` IS FALSE
    `a law provides for the supply` IS FALSE
`a safe use with cybersecurity` MEANS `A use of database information` WITH
    `the supplier is an insurer, reinsurer, branch, broker, ancillary provider or mutual organisation` IS FALSE
    `supplied information on the policyholder, insured person, object, agent and other related information` IS FALSE
    `ensured confidentiality` IS TRUE
    `ensured information safety` IS FALSE
    `ensured cybersecurity` IS TRUE
    `complied with the law on privacy, personal, family and business secrets` IS TRUE
    `used the information for the purpose supplied` IS TRUE
    `gave it to a third party` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder or insured person agreed` IS FALSE
    `a law provides for the supply` IS FALSE
`a use that gave data to a third party without consent` MEANS `A use of database information` WITH
    `the supplier is an insurer, reinsurer, branch, broker, ancillary provider or mutual organisation` IS FALSE
    `supplied information on the policyholder, insured person, object, agent and other related information` IS FALSE
    `ensured confidentiality` IS TRUE
    `ensured information safety` IS FALSE
    `ensured cybersecurity` IS TRUE
    `complied with the law on privacy, personal, family and business secrets` IS TRUE
    `used the information for the purpose supplied` IS TRUE
    `gave it to a third party` IS TRUE
    `the policyholder or insured person agreed` IS FALSE
    `a law provides for the supply` IS FALSE
`a use that gave data to a third party with consent` MEANS `A use of database information` WITH
    `the supplier is an insurer, reinsurer, branch, broker, ancillary provider or mutual organisation` IS FALSE
    `supplied information on the policyholder, insured person, object, agent and other related information` IS FALSE
    `ensured confidentiality` IS TRUE
    `ensured information safety` IS FALSE
    `ensured cybersecurity` IS TRUE
    `complied with the law on privacy, personal, family and business secrets` IS TRUE
    `used the information for the purpose supplied` IS TRUE
    `gave it to a third party` IS TRUE
    `the policyholder or insured person agreed` IS TRUE
    `a law provides for the supply` IS FALSE
`a supply by an insurer of the information` MEANS `A use of database information` WITH
    `the supplier is an insurer, reinsurer, branch, broker, ancillary provider or mutual organisation` IS TRUE
    `supplied information on the policyholder, insured person, object, agent and other related information` IS TRUE
    `ensured confidentiality` IS FALSE
    `ensured information safety` IS FALSE
    `ensured cybersecurity` IS FALSE
    `complied with the law on privacy, personal, family and business secrets` IS FALSE
    `used the information for the purpose supplied` IS FALSE
    `gave it to a third party` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder or insured person agreed` IS FALSE
    `a law provides for the supply` IS FALSE
`an insurer that supplied nothing` MEANS `A use of database information` WITH
    `the supplier is an insurer, reinsurer, branch, broker, ancillary provider or mutual organisation` IS TRUE
    `supplied information on the policyholder, insured person, object, agent and other related information` IS FALSE
    `ensured confidentiality` IS FALSE
    `ensured information safety` IS FALSE
    `ensured cybersecurity` IS FALSE
    `complied with the law on privacy, personal, family and business secrets` IS FALSE
    `used the information for the purpose supplied` IS FALSE
    `gave it to a third party` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder or insured person agreed` IS FALSE
    `a law provides for the supply` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `Dieu 11(2): the supplier has supplied the information the database needs` `a supply by an insurer of the information`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 11(2): the supplier has supplied the information the database needs` `an insurer that supplied nothing`
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 11(3): the collection, use, storage and supply of database information complies` `a safe use with information safety`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 11(3): the collection, use, storage and supply of database information complies` `a safe use with cybersecurity`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 11(3): the collection, use, storage and supply of database information complies` `a safe use with information safety`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 11(3): the collection, use, storage and supply of database information complies` `a safe use with cybersecurity`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 11(3): the collection, use, storage and supply of database information complies` `a safe use with cybersecurity`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 11(3): the collection, use, storage and supply of database information complies` `a use that gave data to a third party without consent`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 11(3): the collection, use, storage and supply of database information complies` `a use that gave data to a third party with consent`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 11(5): the Government's detailed rules on the database`

§§ `Dieu 12, 13, 14`

